score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," with a weapon from that group, you can make one immediate extra attack (in addition to the other effects of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},") against a single target within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". You may only use this Talent once per turn. You can select this Talent multiple times. its effects do not stack. Each time you take the Talent, it applies to a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Knockback"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," against a target no more than two size categories larger than you are, you can choose to move that opponent 1 square in any direction as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},". You cannot use this Talent on an opponent that is being ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"},", and you cannot move your target into a solid object or into another creature's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Reduce Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","child